ghidra_out/installed_game/compiled_game_entries.csv binary
lift/reports/** whitespace=-trailing-space,-blank-at-eof
lift/state/** whitespace=-trailing-space,-blank-at-eof
rebuild/backlog/** whitespace=-trailing-space,-blank-at-eof
rebuild/candidates/snapshots/** whitespace=-trailing-space,-blank-at-eof

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.pdf binary
